00:46:21.700 --> 00:46:22.200
&gt;&gt; ELA: Hm.

00:46:22.600 --> 00:46:23.100
Mami?

00:46:23.800 --> 00:46:24.400
&gt;&gt; SALLY: Warte kurz.

00:46:24.400 --> 00:46:25.800
